  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police, specifically the Bareskrim division, is moving forward with a criminal investigation into allegations of treason directed at President Prabowo Subianto. This inquiry is reportedly linked to suspicions of illegal wiretapping targeting the head of state. Authorities have escalated the status of the investigation to a formal probe following the discovery of evidence at several locations, including a premises in Cipete identified by reports as a base of operations for the accused individuals. Coordinating Minister for Law and Human Rights Yusril Ihza Mahendra has publicly supported the police efforts, emphasizing the necessity of uncovering the figures behind these activities. The current phase involves a scheduled case review by Bareskrim to evaluate the gathered evidence and determine the next legal steps in the ongoing treason inquiry.",
